# Space Adventure Cobra boots through several skippable video/legal screens before its menu.
# Repeated, separated Cross pulses keep the route deterministic across video-decoder timing while
# avoiding a held-button interpretation. Reaching gameplay is acceptable if a pulse confirms the
# title's default selection.
